{"n": 696, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "696.webp", "text": "35 21000 REMOVING AND INSTALLING\nBRAKE PEDAL\n\nRemove dashboard trim panel at bot-\ntom left - see Group 51.\n\nVersion with Clutch Pedal Return\nSpring:\n\nDisconnect clutch pedal return spring\non body\n\nDisconnect brake pedal return spring\non pedal.\n\nPress off clamp (1) on brake linkage (1)\nPull out shalt (2).\n\nCars with Pedal Value Sender:\nCut off straps and pull wire harness\n\ndown.\n\nNote:\nPedal value is shown removed for\nbetter understanding.\n\nInstallation:\n\nCheck for correct routing — wire\nharness must not rub on any parts of\nthe car!\n\nUnscrew nut.\nPull out shaft and take off pedal.\n\nInstallation:\nReplace self-locking nut.\nTightening torque*.\n\nInstallation:\nCars with over-center spring — check\nfor correct installed position.\n\nInstallation:\n\nAdjust brake pedal height to distance\n(A) on the brake master cylinder push\nrod.\n\nImportant!\n\nTravel must be limited In the brake\nmaster cylinder and must not be Iimit-\ned by, for example, the stop light\nswitch (distance \"B\").\n\n* See Specifications", "words": [["35", 0.2705, 0.0756, 0.2832, 0.0875], ["21000", 0.2872, 0.0756, 0.3217, 0.0869], ["REMOVING", 0.3293, 0.0749, 0.3896, 0.0875], ["AND", 0.3936, 0.0756, 0.4174, 0.0869], ["INSTALLING", 0.421, 0.0756, 0.4873, 0.0875], ["BRAKE", 0.3298, 0.0922, 0.3688, 0.1034], ["PEDAL", 0.3728, 0.0922, 0.4103, 0.1034], ["Remove", 0.2715, 0.1253, 0.3151, 0.1373], ["dashboard", 0.3191, 0.1253, 0.3754, 0.1373], ["trim", 0.3794, 0.1253, 0.4002, 0.1366], ["panel", 0.4043, 0.1253, 0.4326, 0.1399], ["at", 0.4367, 0.1267, 0.4458, 0.1379], ["bot-", 0.4498, 0.126, 0.4706, 0.1379], ["tom", 0.271, 0.1426, 0.2908, 0.1538], ["left", 0.2958, 0.1419, 0.3121, 0.1538], ["-", 0.3156, 0.1479, 0.3227, 0.1505], ["see", 0.3262, 0.1439, 0.344, 0.1538], ["Group", 0.348, 0.1419, 0.381, 0.1565], ["51.", 0.385, 0.1419, 0.4002, 0.1538], ["Version", 0.271, 0.309, 0.3121, 0.321], ["with", 0.3161, 0.309, 0.33